            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'American Mahjong is a North American Mahjong variant with a card-defined hand system and joker usage. It uses an expanded tile set compared with classical Chinese variants and emphasizes matching published hand patterns over unrestricted fan construction.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'American Mahjong developed in the United States as a structured variant with annual hand-card systems and joker rules.',
